1
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:26,400
The smell in the shop just now

2
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,000
was exactly that.

3
00:01:35,600 --> 00:01:36,200
Master.

4
00:01:36,960 --> 00:01:37,759
Goodness.

5
00:01:47,880 --> 00:01:50,539
He actually went straight into Fan Restaurant.

6
00:01:50,759 --> 00:01:52,320
This matter is of great importance.

7
00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:54,050
Follow me to a safe place first.

8
00:02:14,320 --> 00:02:15,000
This piece

9
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:16,680
is Ambush from Ten Sides.

10
00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:30,320
My sister is using the zither to warn me.

11
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:31,760
This area

12
00:02:31,920 --> 00:02:35,050
has been surrounded by Imperial City Department spies.

13
00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:40,120
This one

14
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:43,480
is 'Deep in the Zen Quarters'.

15
00:03:17,440 --> 00:03:18,480
This way, please.

16
00:03:21,440 --> 00:03:23,100
Please wait here for a moment.

17
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:35,240
Sister.

18
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:38,370
You've worked hard.

19
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:45,800
Sister.

20
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:47,640
This time,

21
00:03:47,880 --> 00:03:49,760
I'm afraid I've really dragged you into this.

22
00:03:49,760 --> 00:03:50,600
Between us,

23
00:03:50,600 --> 00:03:52,680
there's no need to talk about being a burden.

24
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:53,480
It's just,

25
00:03:53,480 --> 00:03:54,810
what exactly happened?

26
00:03:55,040 --> 00:03:56,040
Overnight,

27
00:03:56,160 --> 00:03:57,720
you became wanted all over the city.

28
00:03:57,720 --> 00:03:59,120
An open attack is easy to dodge,

29
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:00,560
but a hidden arrow is hard to guard against.

30
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:01,420
Especially...

31
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:03,970
or an arrow in the back from an insider.

32
00:04:06,920 --> 00:04:07,840
Three honored guests,

33
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:09,240
food has been prepared in the side hall.

34
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:10,200
Please enjoy.

35
00:04:15,320 --> 00:04:16,040
Let's go, old man.

36
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:16,920
Brother Chaijiu.

37
00:04:16,920 --> 00:04:17,579
I don't eat.

38
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:20,130
I don't eat cooked food.

39
00:04:20,959 --> 00:04:22,019
I want to eat it raw.

40
00:04:26,280 --> 00:04:27,280
Brother Chaijiu,

41
00:04:28,480 --> 00:04:30,410
you'd better get used to it slowly.

42
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:33,040
To the good days under the bright sun,

43
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:34,040
we have to return.

44
00:04:35,440 --> 00:04:36,880
My poor days in that little mud hut

45
00:04:36,880 --> 00:04:38,120
weren't so bad either.

46
00:04:38,120 --> 00:04:39,000
Then why did you target Lord Chu

47
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:40,240
last night?

48
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:42,520
It wasn't really targeting.

49
00:04:42,840 --> 00:04:43,880
I just felt

50
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:46,000
that someone who was once powerful

51
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:47,860
could fall into the dust the next.

52
00:04:48,159 --> 00:04:49,690
I was just a little curious.

53
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:52,930
Who hasn't had a time of being down and out?

54
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:55,770
The dignified Huo Sanlang in the market back then

55
00:04:56,440 --> 00:04:59,170
now acting so loyal and submissive to his master.

56
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:01,560
More real than my dog brother.

57
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:03,360
Say that again if you dare.

58
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:04,080
Don't be rash, old man.

59
00:05:04,080 --> 00:05:04,680
Old man.

60
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:07,720
But, old man,

61
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:10,460
how did you end up becoming

62
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:11,720
her subordinate?

63
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:16,800
Maybe my strange fire evasion technique

64
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:18,000
was somewhat useful.

65
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:18,600
Didn't it

66
00:05:19,320 --> 00:05:20,400
scare off

67
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:22,930
someone showing their animalistic side?

68
00:05:24,280 --> 00:05:24,920
Brother Chaijiu,

69
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:25,160
don't.

70
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:25,960
Brother Chaijiu, don't be mad.

71
00:05:25,960 --> 00:05:26,690
Don't be mad.

72
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:28,290
Don't be mad.

73
00:05:28,920 --> 00:05:29,440
Old man.

74
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:30,240
Old man.

75
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,800
She doesn't seem that great.

76
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:33,060
Why did you agree to it?

77
00:05:36,840 --> 00:05:38,700
From the first time I saw Lord Chu,

78
00:05:39,640 --> 00:05:41,360
I felt she was my daughter,

79
00:05:42,400 --> 00:05:44,040
because she and my late wife

80
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:46,220
look almost exactly the same.

81
00:05:46,960 --> 00:05:48,490
If my daughter hadn't died,

82
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:51,040
she'd be about her age.

83
00:05:51,880 --> 00:05:52,960
I feel like Lord Chu

84
00:05:53,320 --> 00:05:54,980
is the person I'm looking for.

85
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:56,330
That's how it happened.

86
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:58,680
I didn't expect Feng Xiu to frame me.

87
00:05:59,080 --> 00:05:59,880
Sister.

88
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:01,680
This trouble of yours

89
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:05,780
is probably because of your insistence on catching the assassin.

90
00:06:06,680 --> 00:06:07,920
To protect His Majesty's safety.

91
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:09,640
It is my duty at the Ice Bureau.

92
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:12,040
Why would he frame me at a time like this?

93
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:14,840
Zhou You's actions earlier didn't seem like he wanted to harm you,

94
00:06:14,840 --> 00:06:16,360
but rather to save you.

95
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:17,520
Save me?

96
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,090
What do you mean?

97
00:06:19,240 --> 00:06:21,120
He is the Deputy Director of the Palace Domestic Service.

98
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:22,400
If he wanted to harm you,

99
00:06:22,400 --> 00:06:23,600
he has plenty of ways.

100
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:24,650
Why would he need

101
00:06:24,880 --> 00:06:26,280
to get himself involved?

102
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:27,720
That's the first point.

103
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:28,580
And the second?

104
00:06:28,880 --> 00:06:30,540
If Zhou You wanted to save you,

105
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:33,400
he didn't need to use such obscure methods.

106
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:36,480
So I boldly guess

107
00:06:36,760 --> 00:06:38,620
that the person behind the scenes

108
00:06:38,840 --> 00:06:41,880
must be someone even Zhou You dare not provoke.

109
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:44,960
Someone Zhou You dare not provoke,

110
00:06:46,600 --> 00:06:49,530
and who can also command the Imperial City Division?

111
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:53,200
Could it be

112
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:55,860
the Chief Eunuch Liang Shicheng?

113
00:06:56,320 --> 00:06:57,440
It can only be him.

114
00:06:58,440 --> 00:07:00,200
My Chu family has merit in supporting the Emperor

115
00:07:00,200 --> 00:07:01,440
and has received imperial grace.

116
00:07:01,440 --> 00:07:03,100
Why would he harm me like this?

117
00:07:03,200 --> 00:07:04,400
Don't worry, sister.

118
00:07:04,800 --> 00:07:07,160
If we can get Zhou You's help now,

119
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:09,660
there might still be a turning point.

120
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:11,720
Zhou You and I have no ties.

121
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:15,260
Why would he take such a great risk to help me?

122
00:07:15,440 --> 00:07:16,440
Not necessarily.

123
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:18,560
I

124
00:07:18,840 --> 00:07:21,120
heard a rumor the other day

125
00:07:22,280 --> 00:07:23,800
that Liang Shicheng

126
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:26,130
is deeply colluding with the princes,

127
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:28,410
which has displeased the Emperor.

128
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:29,600
In my opinion,

129
00:07:29,960 --> 00:07:31,200
his favor

130
00:07:31,200 --> 00:07:32,930
is probably not as it used to be.

131
00:07:33,440 --> 00:07:35,240
How can we overcome this ordeal?

132
00:07:35,320 --> 00:07:36,680
In the end,

133
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:37,840
you are the cause of this.

134
00:07:37,840 --> 00:07:39,570
As for catching the assassins,

135
00:07:40,320 --> 00:07:42,080
if you fail to catch them,

136
00:07:42,200 --> 00:07:43,920
and something happens to the Emperor

137
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:45,960
on the day of the Lantern Festival,

138
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:48,600
no matter how good the solution is,

139
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:50,040
you won't be able to escape punishment.

140
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:50,880
Therefore,

141
00:07:51,200 --> 00:07:53,200
I should catch the assassins first

142
00:07:54,200 --> 00:07:56,640
and ensure the Emperor's safety on the night of the Lantern Festival.

143
00:07:56,640 --> 00:07:57,240
Sister.

144
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:58,640
Is there no other way

145
00:07:58,800 --> 00:08:00,040
to find the thieves?

146
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:01,960
There is a way.

147
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:04,260
But come to think of it,

148
00:08:05,320 --> 00:08:06,850
he will also have concerns.

149
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:08,360
Even if we find him.

150
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:11,460
I have no military power or troops right now.

151
00:08:11,960 --> 00:08:14,090
What's the use of finding the thieves?

152
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:14,920
I don't know.

153
00:08:15,480 --> 00:08:17,120
Who has a solution?

154
00:08:17,880 --> 00:08:20,210
It's the idler I mentioned during the day,

155
00:08:20,400 --> 00:08:21,040
Meng Qian.

156
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:24,440
Then there is always a way out.

157
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:26,360
What do you mean, sister?

158
00:08:26,680 --> 00:08:27,880
Is that Meng Qian

159
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:30,760
one of the three who just entered the manor?

160
00:08:37,159 --> 00:08:37,760
Lord Chu.

161
00:08:46,360 --> 00:08:47,400
Young man,

162
00:08:47,400 --> 00:08:47,960
you

163
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:49,650
have been staring at me.

164
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:51,600
Is there something wrong

165
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:52,880
with my face?

166
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:53,880
Keep looking,

167
00:08:53,920 --> 00:08:55,380
and I'll dig your eyes out.

168
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:56,800
My lady,

169
00:08:57,600 --> 00:08:58,930
are you feeling unwell?

170
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:02,640
Why do you say that?

171
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:04,620
I have a younger sister

172
00:09:04,640 --> 00:09:06,500
who has been ill since childhood.

173
00:09:08,160 --> 00:09:09,000
Her posture

174
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:11,120
is very similar to yours.

175
00:09:11,920 --> 00:09:13,080
I see.

176
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:15,680
Pardon my intrusion.

177
00:09:15,680 --> 00:09:16,320
It's fine.

178
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:19,000
You could tell at a glance

179
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:20,520
that I was unwell.

180
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:21,960
It shows

181
00:09:22,280 --> 00:09:25,320
you know your sister's condition well.

182
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:28,220
You are a good brother.

183
00:09:30,160 --> 00:09:33,020
Could my sister-in-law and sister be in this manor?

184
00:09:37,400 --> 00:09:39,460
What does it matter if they are or not?

185
00:09:39,560 --> 00:09:40,480
I told you,

186
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:41,880
they are safe.

187
00:09:42,400 --> 00:09:43,800
As long as you do that job,

188
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:46,320
I naturally won't treat them badly.

189
00:09:46,920 --> 00:09:47,480
What?

190
00:09:47,920 --> 00:09:49,580
You don't believe what I said?

191
00:09:50,040 --> 00:09:51,800
Even if you knew where they are,

192
00:09:52,040 --> 00:09:53,040
what could you do?

193
00:09:53,680 --> 00:09:55,600
If you can't catch the Liangshan assassins

194
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:56,680
and get the medicine,

195
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:57,810
even if you see them.

196
00:09:57,920 --> 00:09:59,520
We can't do anything anyway.

197
00:09:59,800 --> 00:10:01,860
We'd better figure out a way quickly.

198
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:03,600
What you said makes sense, sir.

199
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:04,400
Young man.

200
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:06,920
This sister of mine,

201
00:10:06,920 --> 00:10:08,360
though hot-tempered,

202
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:10,760
always keeps her promises and does what she says.

203
00:10:10,760 --> 00:10:12,680
If she says she won't mistreat your sister-in-law and younger sister,

204
00:10:12,680 --> 00:10:14,210
then she definitely won't.

205
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:15,440
You can rest assured.

206
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:17,560
You too, sister.

207
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:20,540
Since everyone is sincere about doing this,

208
00:10:20,640 --> 00:10:22,480
why don't we talk it over nicely?

209
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:24,920
Alright.

210
00:10:25,160 --> 00:10:27,020
Let's get down to business first.

211
00:10:27,280 --> 00:10:27,680
Hurry!

212
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:29,640
Keep up!

213
00:10:32,040 --> 00:10:32,760
Surround them!
